{"id":"mm4_composite_01","unit":"MM4","atoms":["func.log.exp_ln_inverse","func.log.power_rule"],"template":"An encoded measurement has the form e^(ln({value})). Its recovered magnitude is raised to {power}. What is log base {base} of the resulting magnitude?","vars":{"base":{"type":"int","min":2,"max":9},"value":{"type":"int","min":3,"max":120},"power":{"type":"int","min":2,"max":6}},"derive":{},"constraints":[],"example":{"vars":{"value":12,"power":2,"base":3},"answer":"log(144)/log(3)"}}
