{"id":"mm4_composite_33","unit":"MM4","atoms":["prob.proportion.distribution","prob.proportion.confidence_interval","prob.proportion.standardize","func.log.equation","func.log.product_rule","func.log.natural"],"template":"A model's central proportion forms an interval at z = {z}; its lower endpoint is compared with benchmark p = {p0_num}/100 to produce a standardized score. A report uses base {base} and that score as an exponent, scales the resulting factor by {factor}, and records its natural logarithm. What is the report?","vars":{"base":{"type":"int","min":2,"max":9},"factor":{"type":"int","min":2,"max":9},"sample_size":{"type":"int","min":80,"max":300},"z":{"type":"int","min":1,"max":3},"p_num":{"type":"int","min":20,"max":70},"p0_num":{"type":"int","min":5,"max":30}},"derive":{"pfrac":"Fraction(p_num,100)","p0":"Fraction(p0_num,100)"},"constraints":["p_num >= p0_num + 20"],"example":{"vars":{"p_num":50,"sample_size":100,"z":2,"p0_num":10,"factor":3,"base":2,"pfrac":"1/2","p0":"1/10"},"answer":"log(log(3072)/log(2))"}}
